  "description": "VOODOO WAZOO\n\nThe Wazoo is a 27.5+ hardtail designed to be at home when the trails get muddy and bogged down. The frame incorporates dropped chainstays for wider tire clearance, while the modern cockpit and geometry allows you to easily maneuver your body, keeping you in a comfortable riding position while riding through difficult terrain. The traditional 2x chainset provides closer gear ratios, allowing you to find the perfect gear when grinding through muddy trails. The fat, 2.6” Maxxis Rekon+ tires hold the bike firmly on the trail with dependable grip around corners, oozing confidence in conditions that would hamper other bikes.\n\nIn mountain biking, the challenge never ends, and the Wazoo will be with you every step of the way!\n\n27.5+ of fun even if mud",
